    "body": "The machine owner says this scheme (`G41`/`G42 Hnnn` per pass, `G40` on the lead-out, minimum lead-in = wire radius) carries over to other wire EDM brands with small changes. Keep the offset logic in a shared helper that other wire dialects can call, and keep only the dialect details (H/C number format, where the G41 line goes) in the LN2W post.",
